58083159714", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821115_4304358089826380_8892091282160833163_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AL9uhgLUZ9EQ7kNvwHO7HNt&_nc_oc=AdmtzNI4DabJhATKpSO1rMDfyYrilB-A3GPysRC8ziP_-RmGDk74JJLzGKAbz8E5wlA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxuFd6uXbSdObjh0XUK5-0gJu2KhOEJVHTxPlYvMffbwg&oe=69AFFD03"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "907692608367260", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_907692611700593_4674589555727649664_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mj2cYX43BSwQ7kNvwFvZRYM&_nc_oc=AdlmiqZPalx_vqa1v82MO9iHDVf9wj8wIunqBiSiNApTBMfqExKC_VrbOjzgxz0bWv0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx4m0NGvL_as8tzRqCRfZnsv3nK3VEZoim9rzHgIMDtyA&oe=69B0220D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1202186154717486", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830021_1202186158050819_460802184064812121_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pWNW7HHkYjIQ7kNvwFIU_uI&_nc_oc=AdmVTqUEL1xmu7EeNTO-a4KWxD9Mvz78aabjYyT5d2qlF7DzUBYpFqDJm-ETEh6oDh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzUATPAY_6u6YBpPqnxS0t-RxNVTPdvBC7f98WmcyZphA&oe=69AFF521"}, "display_name": "COLOR FIT Mixed Reality", "keywords": ["fitness", "workout", "boxing", "mixed", "reality"], "long_description": "\nAre you tired of subscription workout apps? then get this one for free.\n\nColor Fit is A mixed reality workout experience that gets your whole body moving. Break boxes using hand tracking while encouraging full-body motion to warm up your muscles. Ideal for morning exercise. The physics-based gameplay makes it surprisingly addictive.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Room-scale mixed reality \u2013 No motion sickness, no hitting walls, and no tripping over kids or pets.\n\n- Hand tracking \u2013 No controllers, and no excuse for breaking your TV.\n\n- Dynamic shadows on virtual objects \u2013 The cubes feel like they truly exist in your room.\n\n- Full-body movement \u2013 You\u2019ll feel every stretch (and maybe hear a few cracks).\n\n- Built with purpose \u2013 I made this app to help relieve my back pain, hopefully, it helps with yours too.\n\n- Early access \u2013 Expect major updates and improvements over time.\n\nPlease join my discord to shape this app based on your feedback. I need you! https://discord.gg/ZGAHEuA", "short_description": "A mixed reality workout app that gets your whole body moving. Smash boxes using hand tracking and full-body motion to warm up your muscles. Perfect for morning workouts, with addictive physics-driven gameplay."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://frozen-dreams.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Frozen Dreams", "support_website_url": "https://frozen-dreams.com/contact/", "website_url": "https://frozen-dreams.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25448157881544052"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_916575924270371_6514931208615496936_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lo2Jy38EY5gQ7kNvwFiH-xk&_nc_oc=AdkqgsP46Ou7IeGm6x6IqtU3WJY-gaQyNDzzw2oX38_L96JRRJ52lpNBGMK0_3tF3Hc&_n